    <item>
      <title>Robby Stein：谷歌AI的深层密码——教机器理解人，而非堆砌功能</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/robby-steinai-20251013104004617-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 10:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
